# Chapter 1 Activity. Start the app first:
#   dotnet run --project AdventureWorks
# (https://localhost:7001 and http://localhost:5001, Development).
# Each "Expect" line is the status you should see.

@host = https://localhost:7001

###
# The root redirects to the status endpoint. Expect 302
GET {{host}}/

###
# The status endpoint. Expect 200 with "status": "Operational"
GET {{host}}/api/status

###
# The health endpoint answers Healthy. Expect 200
GET {{host}}/health

###
# Plain HTTP is redirected to HTTPS. Expect 307
GET http://localhost:5001/api/status

###
# Nothing is mapped here. Expect 404
GET {{host}}/missing

###
# The Activity's diagnostic route.
# Expect 200 with "environment": "Development"
GET {{host}}/api/config
